What:		/sys/bus/hid/devices/<bus>:<vid>:<pid>.<n>/wacom_led/status0_luminance
Date:		August 2014
Contact:	linux-input@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		<obsoleted by the LED class API now exported by the driver>
